WEBVTT

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:02.606
when a friend, Maytha Alhassen,
invited me to Palestine ...

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.058
PA: We were a delegation
of artists and organizers,

00:02:05.082 --> 00:02:07.511
and we immersed ourselves
in Palestinian culture,

00:02:07.535 --> 00:02:09.495
music, their stories.

00:02:09.519 --> 00:02:10.672
Late into the night,

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:14.095
we would have discussions
about the role of art in politics

00:02:14.119 --> 00:02:16.093
and the role of politics in art.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.055
Aja and I disagree.

00:02:18.079 --> 00:02:19.801
AM: Oh, we disagree.

00:02:19.825 --> 00:02:23.364
PA: But we quite quickly
and unsurprisingly fell in love.

00:02:23.388 --> 00:02:24.539
Exhibit A:

00:02:24.563 --> 00:02:26.053
me working my magic.

00:02:26.077 --> 00:02:28.537
(Laughter)

00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:30.231
AM: Obvious, isn't it?